      <uighur>ilegüdkü - ilegüdekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>илүүдэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ILEGYD[E]-</transcript>
      <definition>v.i. To be[come] superfluous, redundant, or abundant; to exceed.</definition>
      <page>405</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠭᠲᠠᠭᠠᠭᠰᠠᠨ ᠺᠡᠮᠵᠢᠶᠡᠨ ᠡᠴᠡ ᠢᠯᠡᠭᠦᠳᠡᠭᠰᠡᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>toγtaγaγsan kemzijen ece - -gsen</transcript>
          <definition> Exceeding the fixed norm, beyond normal.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
